{"id":"pip-3.12-hash.1","n":"pip-3.12-hash","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"python3.12-pip","ver":"23.2.1-4.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/p/python3.12-pip-23.2.1-4.el9.noarch.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/pip-3.12-hash.1.gz","sha256":"d0b183a9e68396e55c3caef387d844e1b7ee475b7d8583e6ecadbb2a674c4271","date":"February 16, 2024","origin":"23.2"}},"nopt":{"r":1},"desc":"description of pip hash command","r":[["NAME","<p>pip-hash - description of pip hash command</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Compute a hash of a local package archive.</p> <p>These can be used with --hash in a requirements file to do repeatable installs.</p>"],["USAGE","<div class=\"in\"> <div class=\"in\">  <pre>python -m pip hash [options] &lt;file&gt; ...\n</pre> </div> <br> </div> <br>"],["OPTIONS","<div class=\"in\"> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-a, --algorithm &lt;algorithm&gt;</b></dt><dd>The hash algorithm to use: one of sha256, sha384, sha512</dd></dl> </div> <br>"],["AUTHOR","<p>pip developers</p>"],["COPYRIGHT","<p>The pip developers</p>"]]}